<section class="moon-rashi-finder" aria-labelledby="moon-rashi-title">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="moon-rashi-card">
    <div class="moon-rashi-copy">
      <p class="moon-rashi-eyebrow">CHANDRA RASHI · जन्म राशि</p>
      <h2 id="moon-rashi-title">Do you know your Moon sign?</h2>
      <p class="moon-rashi-intro">Daily Rashifal is read from your <strong>Janma Rashi</strong>—the sidereal sign occupied by Chandra at birth, not your Western Sun sign.</p>
      <p class="moon-rashi-privacy">🔒 Your details are calculated only in this browser. Click Jyotish does not save them.</p>
    </div>
    <form id="moon-rashi-form" class="moon-rashi-form">
      <label for="moon-rashi-date"><span>Date of birth</span><input id="moon-rashi-date" name="birthDate" type="date" required /></label>
      <label for="moon-rashi-time"><span>Time of birth</span><input id="moon-rashi-time" name="birthTime" type="time" required /></label>
      <label for="moon-rashi-place"><span>Place of birth (India)</span><input id="moon-rashi-place" name="birthPlace" type="text" placeholder="e.g. New Delhi" autocomplete="address-level2" required /></label>
      <button type="submit">Know my Chandra Rashi →</button>
      <small>For births outside India or an uncertain birth time, request a personal check below.</small>
    </form>
    <div id="moon-rashi-result" class="moon-rashi-result" hidden aria-live="polite">
      <p class="moon-result-label">YOUR JANMA RASHI · आपकी जन्म राशि</p>
      <h3 id="moon-rashi-result-title"></h3><p id="moon-rashi-result-copy"></p>
      <a id="moon-rashi-read-link" href="#rashifal">Read my Rashifal ↓</a>
    </div>
    <details class="moon-rashi-name-help">
      <summary>Birth time not known? Find your Naam Rashi</summary>
      <p class="moon-rashi-name-description">Enter the first sound of the name given at <em>Namkaran</em> for an instant traditional <strong>Naam Rashi</strong> clue. It is not an exact Chandra Rashi; names and regional naming charts can vary.</p>
      <form id="moon-rashi-name-form" class="moon-rashi-name-form">
        <label class="sr-only" for="moon-rashi-name">Name used at Namkaran</label>
        <input id="moon-rashi-name" type="text" placeholder="e.g. Rahul / राहुल" autocomplete="name" required />
        <button type="submit" id="moon-rashi-name-submit">Find my Naam Rashi →</button>
      </form>
      <div id="moon-rashi-name-result" class="moon-rashi-name-result" hidden aria-live="polite">
        <p class="moon-rashi-name-result-label">TRADITIONAL NAAM RASHI</p>
        <h3 id="moon-rashi-name-result-title"></h3>
        <p id="moon-rashi-name-result-copy"></p>
        <a href="#moon-rashi-title" class="moon-rashi-name-exact-link">Use birth details for exact Chandra Rashi ↑</a>
      </div>
      <details class="moon-rashi-letter-chart">
        <summary>View the traditional Naam Rashi letter guide</summary>
        <p class="moon-rashi-letter-guide-copy">These common naming syllables are a helpful reference only. Customs and pronunciations differ by family and region.</p>
        <div class="moon-rashi-letter-grid" aria-label="Traditional Naam Rashi letter guide">
          <div><strong>मेष · Aries</strong><span>चू · चे · चो · ला · ली · लू · ले · लो · अ</span></div>
          <div><strong>वृषभ · Taurus</strong><span>ई · ऊ · ए · ओ · वा · वी · वू · वे · वो</span></div>
          <div><strong>मिथुन · Gemini</strong><span>का · की · कू · घ · ङ · छ · के · को · हा</span></div>
          <div><strong>कर्क · Cancer</strong><span>ही · हू · हे · हो · डा · डी · डू · डे · डो</span></div>
          <div><strong>सिंह · Leo</strong><span>मा · मी · मू · मे · मो · टा · टी · टू · टे</span></div>
          <div><strong>कन्या · Virgo</strong><span>टो · पा · पी · पू · ष · ण · ठ · पे · पो</span></div>
          <div><strong>तुला · Libra</strong><span>रा · री · रू · रे · रो · ता · ती · तू · ते</span></div>
          <div><strong>वृश्चिक · Scorpio</strong><span>तो · ना · नी · नू · ने · नो · या · यी · यू</span></div>
          <div><strong>धनु · Sagittarius</strong><span>ये · यो · भा · भी · भू · ध · फा · ढा · भे</span></div>
          <div><strong>मकर · Capricorn</strong><span>भो · जा · जी · खी · खू · खा · खो · गा · गी</span></div>
          <div><strong>कुंभ · Aquarius</strong><span>गू · गे · गो · सा · सी · सू · से · सो · दा</span></div>
          <div><strong>मीन · Pisces</strong><span>दी · दू · थ · झ · ञ · दे · दो · चा · ची</span></div>
        </div>
      </details>
    </details>
  </div></div>
</section>

